# [R:pin-eol-for-executable-text] — pin LF for every text layer. A platform
# line-ending default (core.autocrlf on Windows) silently breaks a build layer
# on fresh clone, with no error. Fix structurally, not with a check.
*.rs   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
